%% D2: the MPC, one cycle
flowchart TB
  ST[State from EKF₂<br/>rear-axle pose, speed, yaw rate]
  RL[Race line<br/>waypoints with speeds]
  DC[Delay compensation<br/>replay recent commands to predict<br/>where the car will be when this one lands]
  RW[Reference window<br/>the stretch of race line ahead]
  LIN[Linearise the bicycle model<br/>around that reference]
  QP[Solve a quadratic program<br/>cost: tracking + effort + smoothness<br/>limits: dynamics, steering, acceleration]
  FS[Apply the first step only]
  SPD[Speed command<br/>from the planned acceleration]
  STR[Steering command]
  ST --> DC --> RW
  RL --> RW
  RW --> LIN --> QP --> FS
  FS --> SPD
  FS --> STR
  FS -.->|next cycle: plan again| DC
